02ac09df3c5138ec96351a7212585512fcc287a86fce3e6", "text": "J\u00fcrgen Klopp built his career beating money with ideas. At Borussia Dortmund, he won two league titles against Bayern Munich, a club that could outspend him every single summer. When he arrived at Liverpool in October twenty fifteen, that was the plan again. Build a team. Develop players. Spend what you earn. By twenty eighteen, it was working. Liverpool reached a Champions League final, and in the league, only one team stood in their way."}